1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 1=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,180
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:06,260
(The Capital)

7
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:27,380
♪Only when you reach your mid-thirties♪

8
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:38,780
♪Do you learn how vast
the world truly is♪

9
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:51,900
♪You worry about your aging parents♪

10
00:02:51,900 --> 00:03:04,060
♪And your children
yet to find their way♪

11
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:06,520
=Against the Current=

12
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:10,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

13
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:17,860
(Shen Jialan)

14
00:03:17,860 --> 00:03:19,480
(Cui Xuemei,
Shen Jialan's mother)

15
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:22,080
This protective charm
is for Jinqi, isn't it?

16
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,041
Mother.

17
00:03:39,281 --> 00:03:42,480
The Lin family is one of Jiangnan's
most distinguished families.

18
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,960
And Jinqi's grandfather

19
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,360
is the Minister of Personnel.

20
00:03:47,528 --> 00:03:48,880
Once you marry into their family,

21
00:03:49,321 --> 00:03:50,800
you'll have duties toward his parents.

22
00:03:50,841 --> 00:03:52,601
You won't be as carefree
as you are at home.

23
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,321
I had hoped

24
00:03:54,721 --> 00:03:56,001
that after you came of age,

25
00:03:56,104 --> 00:03:57,960
you could stay with us
for another two years.

26
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,121
But by then,

27
00:04:00,321 --> 00:04:01,760
Jinqi will already be over 20.

28
00:04:03,001 --> 00:04:03,920
I'm afraid the Lins

29
00:04:04,721 --> 00:04:06,321
will be eager for the wedding.

30
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:14,960
Worry not.

31
00:04:15,601 --> 00:04:18,480
You are the eldest daughter
of Grand Secretary Shen's household,

32
00:04:18,961 --> 00:04:20,721
and the apple of your parents' eyes.

33
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,120
Our family may not come from
generations of high officials,

34
00:04:26,961 --> 00:04:29,120
but our name still carries
considerable weight.

35
00:04:30,841 --> 00:04:33,000
Whether you marry sooner or later,

36
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,721
you'll always have
our family behind you.

37
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,081
Out! Get out!

38
00:04:44,281 --> 00:04:44,560
Go!

39
00:04:44,776 --> 00:04:45,240
Get out!

40
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,560
This is a pharmacy,

41
00:04:48,761 --> 00:04:49,480
not a charity.

42
00:04:49,496 --> 00:04:51,030
If you can't pay, you don't get treated.

43
00:04:51,041 --> 00:04:51,560
Physician!

44
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,980
(Xu Wanquan, Xu Lanxiang's father)
Please, have mercy! Please!

45
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,360
Please save my daughter!

46
00:04:56,161 --> 00:04:58,201
Please show us some compassion!

47
00:04:58,296 --> 00:05:00,730
(Xue Guihua, Xu Lanxiang's mother)
We'll do anything you ask.

48
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:02,120
We'll spend our lives repaying you!

49
00:05:02,201 --> 00:05:02,890
Go on, get out!

50
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,161
Get moving!

51
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,880
I don't need your family working for me!

52
00:05:05,961 --> 00:05:06,721
Physician!

53
00:05:07,161 --> 00:05:07,680
I...

54
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,000
Please...

55
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,721
I'm begging you!

56
00:05:10,961 --> 00:05:12,161
Please!

57
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,081
I...

58
00:05:13,401 --> 00:05:15,081
She's my only daughter.

59
00:05:15,761 --> 00:05:17,000
Please save her!

60
00:05:17,281 --> 00:05:18,281
Please!

61
00:05:18,521 --> 00:05:19,440
I've told you.

62
00:05:19,450 --> 00:05:20,550
Stop disrupting my business!

63
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,380
Now get out of here!

64
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:22,400
Please, I'm begging you!

65
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:22,880
Get out!

66
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:23,601
Please!

67
00:05:23,601 --> 00:05:24,641
She's our only daughter!

68
00:05:24,761 --> 00:05:25,521
Have mercy!

69
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,320
Let go of me!

70
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,081
I'm begging you!

71
00:05:28,081 --> 00:05:29,081
Please, we beg you!

72
00:05:29,201 --> 00:05:29,920
Don't go!

73
00:05:30,344 --> 00:05:31,000
What rotten luck!

74
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,521
Don't go!

75
00:05:32,201 --> 00:05:33,201
Please don't go!

76
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:40,281
Have mercy! Please save our child!

77
00:05:41,041 --> 00:05:43,120
Please save her!

78
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:46,180
(Xu Lanxiang)

79
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:49,081
Someone, please save her!

80
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,761
(Yong'an Pharmacy)
Please, we're begging you!

81
00:05:51,841 --> 00:05:54,161
We'll do anything you ask!

82
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,440
Please, we beg you!

83
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,440
Save our daughter!

84
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:58,961
Stop.

85
00:05:58,961 --> 00:06:00,360
Please!

86
00:06:15,721 --> 00:06:16,240
This way.

87
00:06:33,928 --> 00:06:35,300
(Sun Wujing)
Madam, this family

88
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:37,630
(Madam Cui's housekeeper)
of three is registered servants.

89
00:06:37,641 --> 00:06:39,161
Their daughter has been ill for years.

90
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,041
Fearing it might spread,

91
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,641
their master sent them away.

92
00:06:45,401 --> 00:06:47,761
But the girl's condition

93
00:06:47,841 --> 00:06:49,041
has taken a turn for the worse.

94
00:06:49,761 --> 00:06:50,961
Poor child.

95
00:06:52,761 --> 00:06:54,120
Give them ten taels of silver.

96
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,360
Yes, Madam.

97
00:06:58,841 --> 00:06:59,240
Here.

98
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,961
Take it.

99
00:07:06,081 --> 00:07:06,920
Thank you, Madam!

100
00:07:07,761 --> 00:07:08,880
Thank you so much!

101
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:10,961
May you and the young lady

102
00:07:11,161 --> 00:07:13,201
be blessed for your kindness!

103
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,440
Thank you, Madam!

104
00:07:15,041 --> 00:07:16,560
Thank you!

105
00:07:16,641 --> 00:07:17,961
Thank you, Madam!

106
00:07:18,281 --> 00:07:19,320
Bless you both!

107
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,041
Please, get up.

108
00:07:20,041 --> 00:07:21,320
Thank you, Madam!

109
00:07:21,576 --> 00:07:23,400
Hurry and take your daughter
to a physician.

110
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,521
Thank you, Madam!

111
00:07:25,041 --> 00:07:26,320
Thank you so much!

112
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,081
Thank you, Madam!

113
00:07:31,521 --> 00:07:34,761
You're so kind, Madam! Thank you!

114
00:07:35,521 --> 00:07:37,041
Thank you, Madam!

115
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,800
Give them my spare set of clothes, too.

116
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,820
(Qiukui, Shen Jialan's personal maid)

117
00:07:59,281 --> 00:08:00,800
Thank you, Madam!

118
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,360
You're so kind!

119
00:08:14,721 --> 00:08:15,480
She can be saved!

120
00:08:15,841 --> 00:08:17,360
- Our daughter can be saved!
- Yes.

121
00:08:18,721 --> 00:08:20,560
Thank you!

122
00:08:22,761 --> 00:08:24,521
These are our young lady's
spare clothes.

123
00:08:25,368 --> 00:08:27,240
She saw how thinly dressed
your daughter was,

124
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:29,401
so she wanted her to have them.

125
00:08:40,641 --> 00:08:41,560
Thank you.

126
00:09:00,260 --> 00:09:04,281
(Shen Residence, the Capital)
(Virtue Brings Honor)

127
00:09:04,281 --> 00:09:06,080
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

128
00:09:08,361 --> 00:09:09,881
First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

129
00:09:18,328 --> 00:09:21,000
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

130
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,361
Father.

131
00:09:53,208 --> 00:09:55,208
The final volume
of my "Statutes Explained"

132
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:56,870
("Statutes Explained")
has gone missing.

133
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,784
(Shen Boru, Shen Jialan's father)
Did you

134
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:59,650
(Fifth-Rank Deputy Minister of Justice)
take it?

135
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,481
There's something

136
00:10:03,641 --> 00:10:04,920
I'd like to ask you, Father.

137
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,361
Go ahead.

138
00:10:08,761 --> 00:10:09,800
What makes someone a slave?

139
00:10:11,656 --> 00:10:12,800
What makes someone a slave?

140
00:10:16,041 --> 00:10:16,761
A slave

141
00:10:17,281 --> 00:10:18,080
is chattel.

142
00:10:19,241 --> 00:10:20,241
In other words,

143
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,481
slaves are no different from livestock.

144
00:10:23,121 --> 00:10:24,761
They're their master's property,

145
00:10:25,121 --> 00:10:26,920
to do with as the master pleases.

146
00:10:28,241 --> 00:10:29,041
However,

147
00:10:30,241 --> 00:10:31,481
as their masters,

148
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,320
we're still bound by law and propriety.

149
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:36,881
We must teach them loyalty,
duty, and integrity.

150
00:10:37,112 --> 00:10:39,200
That's the foundation
of a well-run household.

151
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,641
I understand.

152
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,840
Our Jialan is such a bright
and eager student.

153
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,320
The Lin family is lucky to have her.

154
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:53,920
In a few days,

155
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,121
we'll host a tea gathering

156
00:10:55,161 --> 00:10:56,401
and invite the Lin family over.

157
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,840
That'll give you and Jinqi
a chance to meet.

158
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:10,820
(Ever Mindful of the Future)

159
00:11:10,820 --> 00:11:14,780
(Lin Zhaoxiang, Lin Jinqi's grandfather,
Second-Rank Minister of Personnel)

160
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,850
(Lin Changzheng, Lin Jinqi's father)

161
00:11:19,864 --> 00:11:22,060
(Seventh-Rank Registrar,
Court of Imperial Ceremonies)

162
00:11:31,481 --> 00:11:32,281
Grandfather.

163
00:11:33,161 --> 00:11:33,680
Father.

164
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:36,460
(Young Lin Jinqi)

165
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,121
You sent for me, Grandfather.

166
00:11:38,281 --> 00:11:39,200
What can I do for you?

167
00:11:45,001 --> 00:11:46,121
Many years ago,

168
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,552
Grand Secretary Shen and I

169
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:51,570
urged the deposed emperor to strip
the regional princes of their power.

170
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,241
Our proposal was rejected.

171
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,481
So much time had passed

172
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:59,680
that I thought the matter was behind us.

173
00:12:00,481 --> 00:12:01,481
But now,

174
00:12:02,761 --> 00:12:06,320
someone has dredged it all back up.

175
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:10,641
His Majesty is furious.

176
00:12:12,361 --> 00:12:14,401
You were only doing your duty.

177
00:12:14,410 --> 00:12:16,390
There was nothing wrong
with advising the emperor

178
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:17,881
to curb the princes' power.

179
00:12:18,401 --> 00:12:19,761
That may be true,

180
00:12:19,992 --> 00:12:22,080
but His Majesty was once
a regional prince himself.

181
00:12:22,121 --> 00:12:23,080
He may use this

182
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,761
to settle the score with our family.

183
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:30,960
Father,

184
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,440
please tell us

185
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,161
what we're supposed to do.

186
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,761
There's only one thing we can do.

187
00:12:39,361 --> 00:12:40,440
You and I

188
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,560
must submit our resignations at once

189
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,320
and seek refuge in Jinling.

190
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:48,641
I've appealed to Grand Secretary Zhao,
one of His Majesty's closest advisers.

191
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,320
If I submit

192
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,800
"A Memorial on the
Deposed Emperor's Misrule,"

193
00:12:54,241 --> 00:12:58,001
Grand Secretary Zhao will
intercede for us.

194
00:12:58,680 --> 00:12:59,680
It should...

195
00:13:04,121 --> 00:13:06,920
It should be enough to save
everyone in our family.

196
00:13:07,864 --> 00:13:08,320
All right.

197
00:13:08,641 --> 00:13:10,121
I'll draft my resignation at once.

198
00:13:10,121 --> 00:13:10,641
Right now.

199
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,641
Grandfather,

200
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,041
shouldn't we warn
Grand Secretary Shen first?

201
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:17,960
After all, I'm engaged
to his eldest daughter.

202
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,641
We'll be lucky to save ourselves.

203
00:13:22,680 --> 00:13:24,600
We can't afford to worry
about another family.

204
00:13:41,401 --> 00:13:42,361
I understand.

205
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:48,960
(Virtue Brings Honor)

206
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:52,161
The orchid symbolizes
grace and integrity.

207
00:13:52,761 --> 00:13:55,241
Our family has always prized
scholarship and propriety.

208
00:13:56,121 --> 00:13:58,641
Our daughters are raised
by those same principles.

209
00:13:59,121 --> 00:14:01,361
(Gu Xuan, Shen Jialan's grandmother)
Every one of them is well educated,

210
00:14:01,481 --> 00:14:03,001
(Matriarch of the Shen family)
with the grace and strength of an orchid.

211
00:14:03,521 --> 00:14:05,481
They're every bit as capable as any man.

212
00:14:05,881 --> 00:14:06,680
Exactly.

213
00:14:06,881 --> 00:14:07,680
- Yes.
- Indeed.

214
00:14:25,600 --> 00:14:28,200
Didn't I say not to serve
the peach pastries?

215
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:29,560
I'll remove them at once.

216
00:14:30,088 --> 00:14:30,860
Jialan, why can't we

217
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:33,310
(Shen Jialian, Shen Jialan's cousin)
have the peach pastries?

218
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:36,241
Is there something wrong with them?

219
00:14:36,361 --> 00:14:37,761
There's nothing wrong with them.

220
00:14:38,121 --> 00:14:39,680
They just shouldn't be served today.

221
00:14:39,944 --> 00:14:42,150
I hear the Lins' fourth daughter
is allergic to peaches,

222
00:14:42,180 --> 00:14:43,881
so she can't have
anything containing them.

223
00:14:44,121 --> 00:14:45,200
These pastries

224
00:14:45,401 --> 00:14:47,361
are made with flour
and preserved peaches.

225
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:49,720
If she eats one by mistake,

226
00:14:50,001 --> 00:14:51,241
we'll have a real problem.

227
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,840
Jialan really does think of everything.

228
00:14:56,008 --> 00:14:56,680
(Xu Chun, Shen Jialan's second aunt)

229
00:14:56,680 --> 00:14:57,790
(Second Madam of the Shen family)
From now on,

230
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:59,281
(Shen Qi, concubine)
you should learn more from your cousin.

231
00:14:59,290 --> 00:14:59,944
(of Shen Jialan's second uncle)

232
00:15:01,121 --> 00:15:02,361
That's not fair!

233
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:04,761
Grandmother and I love peach pastries.

234
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,761
Let's do as your cousin says today.

235
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,720
We can have them another day.

236
00:15:10,761 --> 00:15:12,800
They won't taste the same another day.

237
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,440
You're right.

238
00:15:15,761 --> 00:15:17,521
I've had some peach pastries

239
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,680
sent to your room.

240
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,440
We can stay up by the fire
and talk tonight,

241
00:15:21,464 --> 00:15:22,870
and you can eat as many as you like.

242
00:15:23,881 --> 00:15:24,761
It's a promise then.

243
00:15:25,161 --> 00:15:26,920
I'll see you tonight!

244
00:15:27,761 --> 00:15:28,600
I'll be there.

245
00:15:32,121 --> 00:15:33,001
Grandmother,

246
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,800
your digestion is weak,

247
00:15:34,824 --> 00:15:36,520
so you should eat
small meals more often.

248
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,241
I've asked the cook to
prepare peach pastries,

249
00:15:39,241 --> 00:15:40,720
an almond drink, and preserved plums

250
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:42,400
for you to enjoy after
the tea gathering.

251
00:15:42,761 --> 00:15:44,241
They'll be soothing and nourishing,

252
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,641
and they'll help your digestion.

253
00:15:48,472 --> 00:15:50,200
(Chu Heng, Shen Jialan's third aunt)
See?

254
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:53,361
(Third Madam of the Shen family)
No one is as thoughtful as Jialan.

255
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,241
She certainly takes after you, Xuemei.

256
00:15:58,560 --> 00:15:59,881
Speaking of being thoughtful,

257
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,641
none of us can hold a candle to

258
00:16:02,521 --> 00:16:04,680
Mother's sharp mind.

259
00:16:07,041 --> 00:16:08,800
It's all thanks to Mother's teaching.

260
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,680
Exactly.

261
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,161
Xuemei is right.

262
00:16:19,481 --> 00:16:21,080
(Mid-morning)
It's already midmorning.

263
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:24,641
Why isn't the Lin family here yet?

264
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:40,481
Madam.

265
00:16:41,241 --> 00:16:43,401
These are Young Lady Jialan's
betrothal papers.

266
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,761
And this other document...

267
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:58,020
(Betrothal Papers)

268
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:00,580
(Lin)

269
00:17:11,740 --> 00:17:12,830
(Notice of Dissolution of Betrothal)

270
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:15,330
(The birth charts of Lin Jinqi
and Shen Jialan are incompatible.)

271
00:17:15,340 --> 00:17:17,780
(Their engagement is dissolved,
and they can seek other matches.)

272
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:18,790
(Signed, Lin Changzheng.)

273
00:17:24,481 --> 00:17:25,441
The Lin family

274
00:17:26,281 --> 00:17:27,761
is breaking off the engagement?

275
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,840
The Lin family has gone too far!

276
00:17:44,281 --> 00:17:46,600
I'm going there to
demand an explanation.

277
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:49,368
Prepare the sedan chair!

278
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:51,860
(Virtue Brings Honor)

279
00:17:59,360 --> 00:17:59,961
Over there!

280
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:00,761
Yes!

281
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:01,880
Stay close!

282
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:02,840
Make way!

283
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:03,600
Move!

284
00:18:03,896 --> 00:18:04,640
Out of the way!

285
00:18:04,961 --> 00:18:05,360
Go!

286
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:13,460
(Integrity Above All)

287
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,201
Hurry!

288
00:18:18,481 --> 00:18:19,160
Father.

289
00:18:20,488 --> 00:18:23,200
(Shen Qihan, Shen Jialan's grandfather)
The Imperial Guard is here.

290
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:24,856
(Grand Secretary of Wenyuan Hall
Second-Rank, Minister of Rites)

291
00:18:34,001 --> 00:18:35,001
What are you doing?

292
00:18:38,024 --> 00:18:40,550
We're here under imperial orders
to seize the Shen Residence.

293
00:18:44,560 --> 00:18:45,400
Old Madam Shen.

294
00:18:46,201 --> 00:18:46,961
Madam Shen.

295
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:48,681
Forgive me.

296
00:18:55,201 --> 00:18:57,840
Grand Secretary Shen Qihan

297
00:18:58,392 --> 00:19:00,760
has deceived the throne and
betrayed His Majesty's trust.

298
00:19:01,241 --> 00:19:03,241
He is guilty of disloyalty to the realm.

299
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:08,201
Every male member
of the Shen family is to be executed.

300
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:13,281
The women are to be enslaved
and sent to the Imperial Music Bureau.

301
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:18,360
All family property is to
be confiscated by the state.

302
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:19,800
Move in!

303
00:19:23,912 --> 00:19:24,840
What are you doing?

304
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:28,600
What are you doing?

305
00:19:28,681 --> 00:19:29,800
What do you want from us?

306
00:19:30,281 --> 00:19:31,681
Let go of me!

307
00:19:32,721 --> 00:19:34,080
Keep your hands off my daughter!

308
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,201
What's going on?

309
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:36,961
Let go of my mother!

310
00:19:44,080 --> 00:19:44,840
Stop!

311
00:20:58,500 --> 00:21:01,660
(Integrity Above All)

312
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:20,740
(A Clear Conscience
Before Heaven and Man)

313
00:21:32,441 --> 00:21:33,441
Old Madam,

314
00:21:34,441 --> 00:21:36,120
what exactly happened?

315
00:21:37,521 --> 00:21:38,721
Why is His Majesty

316
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:41,201
accusing Father of treason?

317
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:50,201
When His Majesty was still
a regional prince,

318
00:21:51,921 --> 00:21:55,521
the Old Master urged the deposed
emperor to curb the princes' power.

319
00:21:56,681 --> 00:21:59,160
Now His Majesty wants him

320
00:21:59,441 --> 00:22:01,761
to denounce the deposed
emperor as an unworthy ruler.

321
00:22:03,560 --> 00:22:06,160
But the Old Master refused
to betray his conscience.

322
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:12,320
Your father did nothing wrong.

323
00:22:18,201 --> 00:22:19,001
Grandmother,

324
00:22:20,001 --> 00:22:21,681
what are we going to do now?

325
00:22:24,201 --> 00:22:25,160
What can we do?

326
00:22:27,281 --> 00:22:28,201
This is

327
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:31,360
the Imperial Music Bureau.

328
00:22:32,681 --> 00:22:34,201
They may call it

329
00:22:36,241 --> 00:22:37,521
a place for music and dance,

330
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:39,800
but in truth,

331
00:22:40,241 --> 00:22:42,600
it's nothing but a state-run brothel.

332
00:22:44,681 --> 00:22:47,800
For over a century, our family

333
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:51,241
has been known for scholarship,
propriety, and an untarnished name.

334
00:22:53,041 --> 00:22:57,761
The Old Master lived a life
of unwavering integrity

335
00:22:58,056 --> 00:23:00,520
and earned the respect of
honorable men throughout the realm.

336
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:03,840
As women of the Shen family,

337
00:23:04,088 --> 00:23:05,600
we'd sooner die with our honor intact

338
00:23:06,441 --> 00:23:10,441
than live in disgrace.

339
00:23:21,001 --> 00:23:21,800
Old Madam.

340
00:23:23,721 --> 00:23:26,600
I'm not afraid to die.

341
00:23:28,521 --> 00:23:29,400
But Jialian...

342
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:35,281
She's only ten.

343
00:23:45,001 --> 00:23:45,921
Grandmother.

344
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:49,481
I'm not afraid.

345
00:23:50,320 --> 00:23:51,481
Grandfather always said

346
00:23:52,281 --> 00:23:53,721
the Shen family would rather break

347
00:23:54,521 --> 00:23:55,800
than ever bend.

348
00:24:13,241 --> 00:24:14,201
My brave girl...

349
00:24:15,481 --> 00:24:16,241
This...

350
00:24:16,761 --> 00:24:19,241
I had it prepared for myself.

351
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:23,560
I thought His Majesty
might show some mercy

352
00:24:24,201 --> 00:24:26,201
and punish only the Old Master.

353
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:28,160
Mother...

354
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,840
If he had, old as I am,

355
00:24:30,120 --> 00:24:31,921
I'd have followed him in death.

356
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:33,640
But I never imagined...

357
00:24:41,721 --> 00:24:42,441
Grandmother.

358
00:24:45,961 --> 00:24:46,761
Mother.

359
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:50,921
Don't cry.

360
00:24:54,201 --> 00:24:55,001
Jialan.

361
00:25:01,241 --> 00:25:02,721
I'll go on ahead.

362
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:06,001
When we meet again in the next world,

363
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:09,640
let's share some peach pastries.

364
00:25:11,360 --> 00:25:12,201
Jialian...

365
00:25:13,800 --> 00:25:16,241
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

366
00:25:20,201 --> 00:25:21,281
Jialian...

367
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:25,241
- Jialian!
- Jialian!

368
00:25:25,800 --> 00:25:26,880
Jialian!

369
00:25:27,681 --> 00:25:28,481
Jialian!

370
00:25:29,441 --> 00:25:30,281
Jialian!

371
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:31,840
Mother...

372
00:25:33,281 --> 00:25:35,441
I'm here, darling. I'm here.

373
00:25:35,761 --> 00:25:39,721
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

374
00:25:40,041 --> 00:25:42,201
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

375
00:25:45,761 --> 00:25:46,840
Jialian!

376
00:25:55,201 --> 00:25:56,921
I'm coming with you.

377
00:25:58,521 --> 00:25:59,281
Chun!

378
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:00,201
Aunt Chun!

379
00:26:06,201 --> 00:26:09,080
Don't leave me, Jialian!

380
00:26:12,681 --> 00:26:13,761
Jialian!

381
00:26:14,281 --> 00:26:15,080
Aunt Chun!

382
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:31,360
Jialian...

383
00:26:49,441 --> 00:26:51,201
Use me as a step.

384
00:26:55,761 --> 00:26:56,721
I can't do that!

385
00:26:57,080 --> 00:26:57,800
Mother...

386
00:26:59,721 --> 00:27:02,400
Let me be the one to see you off.

387
00:27:03,120 --> 00:27:07,281
The Shen family has
failed you in this life.

388
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:09,441
In the next,

389
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,640
we'll repay you.

390
00:28:04,201 --> 00:28:05,041
Mother.

391
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:10,241
Let me

392
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,761
do my duty to you one last time

393
00:28:14,721 --> 00:28:17,521
and help you go in peace.

394
00:28:20,481 --> 00:28:21,400
Then I'm afraid...

395
00:28:23,961 --> 00:28:26,041
I'll have to trouble you one last time.

396
00:29:25,201 --> 00:29:26,120
My child...

397
00:29:30,080 --> 00:29:31,201
I'm the one...

398
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:35,400
who gave you life.

399
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,721
Now...

400
00:29:44,681 --> 00:29:47,041
Will you let me take you with me?

401
00:29:51,761 --> 00:29:52,761
That way,

402
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:55,041
your soul

403
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,080
will always remain by my side.

404
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:05,160
We'll stay mother and
daughter through every lifetime,

405
00:30:08,201 --> 00:30:09,681
and we'll never be parted again.

406
00:30:26,456 --> 00:30:27,640
Thank you for everything

407
00:30:29,360 --> 00:30:31,721
you and Father have done for me.

408
00:30:34,521 --> 00:30:35,560
In the next life,

409
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,560
I hope I can be your daughter again.

410
00:30:55,940 --> 00:30:57,900
♪A lone figure wanders
down the old lane♪

411
00:30:58,940 --> 00:31:01,420
♪The heart remembers
what time cannot erase♪

412
00:31:02,220 --> 00:31:06,420
♪One thought brings sorrow,
another dreams of brighter days♪

413
00:31:08,700 --> 00:31:11,220
♪I never ask how long the road will be♪

414
00:31:11,580 --> 00:31:13,940
♪Or what changes fate may bring♪

415
00:31:14,660 --> 00:31:19,820
♪I only wish for one
gentle ray of light♪

416
00:31:23,820 --> 00:31:27,100
♪Step by step, page by page♪

417
00:31:27,460 --> 00:31:29,860
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

418
00:31:30,260 --> 00:31:36,460
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

419
00:31:36,460 --> 00:31:39,580
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

420
00:31:39,940 --> 00:31:42,580
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

421
00:31:42,580 --> 00:31:48,980
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

422
00:31:58,820 --> 00:32:04,560
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)

423
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:07,360
(This protective charm
is for Jinqi, isn't it?)

424
00:32:08,400 --> 00:32:09,481
(Mother...)

425
00:32:31,060 --> 00:32:34,100
♪Step by step, page by page♪

426
00:32:34,420 --> 00:32:37,220
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

427
00:32:37,220 --> 00:32:43,140
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

428
00:32:43,580 --> 00:32:46,740
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

429
00:32:46,740 --> 00:32:49,580
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

430
00:32:49,580 --> 00:32:56,780
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

431
00:33:09,120 --> 00:33:11,041
Heavens!

432
00:33:28,560 --> 00:33:29,441
I was hoping

433
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:31,040
to take the young, pretty ones

434
00:33:31,041 --> 00:33:32,481
and train them myself.

435
00:33:34,080 --> 00:33:35,241
But now look at this...

436
00:33:47,241 --> 00:33:48,800
The Shen family...

437
00:33:51,320 --> 00:33:52,880
What a stubborn family.

438
00:33:57,041 --> 00:33:58,120
Old Madam Shen.

439
00:33:59,521 --> 00:34:00,961
The eldest Shen daughter.

440
00:34:01,961 --> 00:34:03,080
Third Madam Shen.

441
00:34:10,200 --> 00:34:11,521
Shen Jialian and her mother.

442
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,441
Shen Jialan and her mother.

443
00:34:23,841 --> 00:34:24,640
They're all here.

444
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:09,441
Child, you...

445
00:35:09,481 --> 00:35:10,361
Let me die!

446
00:35:10,401 --> 00:35:10,801
Let go.

447
00:35:10,841 --> 00:35:11,680
Let me die!

448
00:35:11,720 --> 00:35:12,921
Let me die!

449
00:35:13,720 --> 00:35:15,160
- Please let go.
- Let me die!

450
00:35:15,240 --> 00:35:17,640
- Let go.
- I want to be with my mother!

451
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:18,240
Listen to me.

452
00:35:18,472 --> 00:35:19,520
Please listen to me!

453
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:20,560
What's going on?

454
00:35:20,560 --> 00:35:22,881
- Let me die!
- Let go.

455
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:26,481
Xu, come here!

456
00:35:27,001 --> 00:35:28,200
What's happening?

457
00:35:29,361 --> 00:35:31,760
I want to be with my mother! Let me go!

458
00:35:31,961 --> 00:35:33,361
If anyone aboard hears you...

459
00:35:33,401 --> 00:35:35,560
- Let go!
- We'll all be killed!

460
00:35:57,080 --> 00:35:57,921
Mother...

461
00:36:01,441 --> 00:36:05,361
Why did you leave me behind all alone?

462
00:36:08,841 --> 00:36:09,560
My dear...

463
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:14,001
If there'd been even the slightest hope,

464
00:36:15,481 --> 00:36:16,640
no mother

465
00:36:18,361 --> 00:36:20,041
would ever willingly watch

466
00:36:20,961 --> 00:36:22,600
her own daughter die before her eyes.

467
00:36:56,881 --> 00:37:00,521
I can never repay you in this life.

468
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:05,280
If we meet again in the next,

469
00:37:05,368 --> 00:37:07,544
I swear I'll repay the kindness
you've shown me today.

470
00:37:07,881 --> 00:37:09,961
Please don't say that, Madam.

471
00:37:11,080 --> 00:37:12,321
By heaven's grace,

472
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:16,481
we happened to be lodging at the
Imperial Music Bureau, doing odd jobs.

473
00:37:17,321 --> 00:37:18,640
That's how we found you.

474
00:37:21,481 --> 00:37:22,921
The money you gave us

475
00:37:23,600 --> 00:37:25,481
couldn't save Lanxiang,

476
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:28,024
but it allowed her to
spend her final days

477
00:37:28,040 --> 00:37:29,280
in comfort.

478
00:37:31,160 --> 00:37:32,280
She was wearing

479
00:37:32,321 --> 00:37:34,361
the beautiful clothes
your daughter gave her

480
00:37:35,080 --> 00:37:36,801
when she passed, happy and at peace.

481
00:37:41,441 --> 00:37:42,361
Go, quickly.

482
00:37:42,481 --> 00:37:44,280
Someone could come at any moment.

483
00:38:29,240 --> 00:38:30,041
Guihua...

484
00:38:31,640 --> 00:38:32,680
Don't worry.

485
00:38:34,640 --> 00:38:35,720
When I reach the other side,

486
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:39,921
I'll take good care of Lanxiang

487
00:38:41,240 --> 00:38:42,801
and love her as my own.

488
00:38:47,600 --> 00:38:49,080
My daughter, Lanxiang...

489
00:38:53,080 --> 00:38:54,361
Her father's carrying her

490
00:38:55,160 --> 00:38:56,001
on his back.

491
00:39:29,680 --> 00:39:32,160
We left Lanxiang's body in your place.

492
00:39:37,160 --> 00:39:39,481
Now our daughter

493
00:39:39,481 --> 00:39:41,080
is lying there beside your mother,

494
00:39:41,480 --> 00:39:43,496
with no one to lay
either of them to rest.

495
00:39:44,801 --> 00:39:46,321
If you kill yourself,

496
00:39:48,321 --> 00:39:50,481
you'll be betraying
your mother's sacrifice,

497
00:39:51,881 --> 00:39:53,720
and Lanxiang's as well.

498
00:40:02,680 --> 00:40:03,921
And if you really do die

499
00:40:04,680 --> 00:40:06,080
here on this boat,

500
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:08,401
and word gets out,

501
00:40:10,521 --> 00:40:12,321
we'll probably be killed as well.

502
00:40:44,280 --> 00:40:45,441
Madam asked me

503
00:40:46,680 --> 00:40:48,200
to give this to you.

504
00:41:18,140 --> 00:41:25,220
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)
(LIVE)

505
00:42:22,580 --> 00:42:29,700
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)
(LIVE)

506
00:43:04,780 --> 00:43:07,700
=Against The Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

507
00:43:14,361 --> 00:43:15,600
Heaven above,

508
00:43:16,240 --> 00:43:17,441
and Earth below, bear witness.

509
00:43:18,361 --> 00:43:21,160
Today, honorable men
have recovered the remains

510
00:43:21,441 --> 00:43:23,560
of the Shen family and Lanxiang

511
00:43:24,560 --> 00:43:26,041
and laid them all to rest.

512
00:43:26,920 --> 00:43:28,360
I owe them a debt beyond measure.

513
00:43:29,560 --> 00:43:31,200
I'll never forget what they've done,

514
00:43:31,921 --> 00:43:33,600
and I swear I'll repay them one day.

515
00:43:54,661 --> 00:43:58,781
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

516
00:44:01,621 --> 00:44:06,141
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

517
00:44:07,421 --> 00:44:11,341
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

518
00:44:12,021 --> 00:44:14,781
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

519
00:44:15,501 --> 00:44:17,821
♪Though all the world may fade♪

520
00:44:17,821 --> 00:44:20,901
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

521
00:44:22,421 --> 00:44:26,661
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

522
00:44:29,581 --> 00:44:33,741
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

523
00:44:35,541 --> 00:44:39,101
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

524
00:44:39,101 --> 00:44:42,661
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

525
00:44:43,461 --> 00:44:49,141
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

526
00:44:49,501 --> 00:44:53,821
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

527
00:44:54,181 --> 00:44:57,141
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

528
00:44:57,141 --> 00:45:00,901
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

529
00:45:00,901 --> 00:45:03,781
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

530
00:45:03,781 --> 00:45:07,861
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

531
00:45:07,861 --> 00:45:11,221
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

532
00:45:11,221 --> 00:45:14,981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

533
00:45:14,981 --> 00:45:18,981
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

534
00:45:19,741 --> 00:45:23,901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

535
00:45:23,901 --> 00:45:27,341
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

